  "title": "Contemporary Mathematics (OpenStax)",
  "originalText": "Contemporary Mathematics is designed to meet the scope and sequence requirements for a liberal arts mathematics course. This resource provides stand-alone sections with a focus on showing relevance in the features as well as the examples, exercises, and exposition. Contemporary Mathematics integrates technology applications, projects, and highlights a diverse group of contributors to mathematics, statistics, and related fields.\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\nFront Matter\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n1:  Sets\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n2: Logic\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n3: Real Number Systems and Number Theory\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n4:  Number Representation and Calculation\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n5:  Algebra\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n6: Money Management\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n7: Probability\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n8: Statistics\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n9: Metric Measurement\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n10:  Geometry\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n11: Voting and Apportionment\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n12: Graph Theory\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n13:  Math and...\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n14: Appendix\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\n15: Answer Key\n\n[Figure: mindtouch.page#thumbnail]\nBack Matter\n\nThumbnail: Black Calculator Near Ballpoint Pen on White Printed Paper. (Pexels License; via Pixabay)\n\nThis page titled Contemporary Mathematics (OpenStax) was last modified on Thu, 02 Jan 2025 09:26:55 GMT and is shared under a CC BY  4.0  license and was authored, remixed, and/or curated by OpenStax via source content that was edited to the style and standards of the LibreTexts platform.",
